# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `swift test --sanitize=address` on Linux.
#
# corelibs XCTest keeps three of its own structures alive until the process
# exits, and LeakSanitizer reports them:
#
# - the generated test-discovery tables (each class's `allTests` list), built
#   while SwiftPM lists the tests (`--dump-tests-json`), before any test runs;
# - the suite that `XCTMainMisc` builds from the arguments, also before any
#   test runs;
# - the suite runs that `XCTestSuiteRun.init(test:)` records.
#
# Each entry names a frame that only those allocations pass through. A leak
# from engine or Core code under test has none of these frames and still
# fails the run.
leak:PackageDiscoveredTests
leak:XCTMainMisc
leak:$s6XCTest0A8SuiteRunC4testAc2AC_tcfC
